{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In <i>Wald-Guard</i>, you take on the role of a tiny bumblebee on a special journey in the form of a 2D platformer with the twist of the Floor being \u201cLava\u201d<br> With precise controls and quick reactions, you'll navigate challenging platforming sections, always in search of floating hearts. Every jump counts \u2013 one mistake, and you fall.</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A unique 2D platformer with one simple rule: the ground is forbidden</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect hidden hearts and find your own path through each level</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A wordless, atmospheric experience \u2013 completely without combat</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Optional accessibility features for a flexible, inclusive gameplay experience</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A moody, immersive soundtrack that carries you through the world</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Easy to learn, hard to master \u2013 <i>Wald-Guard</i> is a quiet challenge for anyone who wants to fly without ever touching the ground.</strong></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"An Usual Start","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3844490/120d7b77f97a6e6c91413a2f52f0015b4bd711fa.jpg"},{"name":"Is your pilot license legit?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3844490/6540b8290ed12c0e3939295ca50af1e315d68999.jpg"},{"name":"Fresh Feelings","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3844490/1a4d7850ee48c5c36fe9f7d176e811fe2baa584a.jpg"},{"name":"Leafless Longing","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3844490/f8517db90492b955ed8cde3971823409d0b4a102.jpg"},{"name":"Unpleasant Unending","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.co